{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel markets mostly rebounded, with timespreads and margins both kickstarting the week firmer despite softer cash premiums, while both window spot activity and refiner spot sale discussions stayed upbeat.Some October discussions did emerge, with at least one refiner in discussion and with…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel markets mostly rebounded, with timespreads and margins both kickstarting the week firmer despite softer cash premiums, while both window spot activity and refiner spot sale discussions stayed upbeat."]},{"type":"p","children":["Some October discussions did emerge, with at least one refiner in discussion and with levels in the premiums territory. Separately, some end-September cargoes were done at flat to small premiums late last Friday."]},{"type":"p","children":["The east-west price spread widened back to discounts of slightly more than $140 per metric ton, with arbitrage margins still favouring west instead of east."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) rose by $4 to almost $68 a barrel, tracking gains in the swaps market and ICE gasoil futures."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials (GO10-SIN-DIF) however went in the opposite direction and declined to $3.86 a barrel, hovering at slightly more than one-month lows."]},{"type":"p","children":["Some China-loading barrels for September were heard on offer in the market since late last week, with more expected in the coming week."]},{"type":"p","children":["At least two sellers were offering mid-September jet fuel in the afternoon trading session."]},{"type":"p","children":["Regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) widened to larger discounts of around $5.5 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- One gasoil deal, no jet fuel deal"]},{"type":"p","children":["NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Asia's diesel exports to Africa are set to hit at least a 4-1/2-year high in August, data from ship trackers and trade sources showed, as African buyers sought alternative supplies following a fall in shipments from the Middle East."]},{"type":"p","children":["- The number of visible commodity vessels transiting the Strait of Hormuz dropped to five per day over the weekend, shipping data showed on Monday, as companies tread cautiously amid continued attacks on ships."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Saudi Arabia is likely to raise its official selling prices (OSPs) for crude oil bound for Asia in October, a Reuters survey showed, after Middle East spot crude markets rallied on tighter supplies and firm demand."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices were trading nearly 2% higher on Monday after the U.S. attacked an Iranian island in the Strait of Hormuz and drew retaliation from Tehran, as their conflict extended into its sixth month."]},{"type":"p","children":["PRICES"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["MIDDLE DISTILLATES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CASH ($/BBL)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["ASIA CLOSE"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Change"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Prev Close"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["RIC"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Spot Gas Oil 0.25%"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["147.06"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["4.60"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","ch